What is printed when the following Java code runs?
```java
class SimpleResource implements AutoCloseable {
    public void doWork() {
        System.out.print("Work ");
    }
    @Override
    public void close() {
        System.out.print("Closed ");
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        try (SimpleResource res = new SimpleResource()) {
            res.doWork();
        }
    }
}
```

