What is the output of the following program inspecting suppressed exceptions?
```java
class ExplodingResource implements AutoCloseable {
    @Override
    public void close() throws Exception {
        throw new IllegalStateException("CloseEx");
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        try (ExplodingResource r = new ExplodingResource()) {
            throw new RuntimeException("TryEx");
        } catch (Exception e) {
            System.out.print(e.getMessage() + " ");
            Throwable[] suppressed = e.getSuppressed();
            System.out.print(suppressed.length + ":" + suppressed[0].getMessage());
        }
    }
}
```
